{'symbol': 'O', 'date': '2023-02-14 17:05:00', 'title': '119TH COMMON STOCK MONTHLY DIVIDEND INCREASE DECLARED BY REALTY INCOME', 'text': "SAN DIEGO , FEB. 14, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --REALTY INCOME CORPORATION (REALTY INCOME, NYSE: O), THE MONTHLY DIVIDEND COMPANY®, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED AN INCREASE IN THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK MONTHLY CASH DIVIDEND TO $0.2545 PER SHARE FROM $0.2485 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON MARCH 15, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MARCH 1, 2023, AND REPRESENTS A 3.2% INCREASE OVER THE YEAR-AGO PERIOD."}